n("n1120","s061-04","Auic. 5. metha.","la","source","Avicenna, *Liber de philosophia prima* V 1: *equinitas … in se non est nisi equinitas tantum* (the famous ‘horseness is only horseness’). B: *auic. ij. metha.*, wrong; A’s book number is correct. B checked.","certain")
